[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0489","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0489.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0955","title":"YaBB YaBB.cgi 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"YaBB（Yet Another Bulletin Board）1 Gold SP1 及更早版本中的 YaBB.cgi 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 num 参数注入恶意脚本代码，当其他用户访问包含该参数的错误页面时，注入的脚本将在受害者浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或恶意操作。攻击条件简单，仅需构造特制 URL 诱使用户点击即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0955"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:27Z","remediation":"升级 YaBB 至 1 Gold SP2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 YaBB.cgi 中 num 参数未过滤导致的 XSS 漏洞。如无法升级，编辑 YaBB.cgi 源码，对 num 参数进行 HTML 实体编码（如将 < 替换为 &lt;），或部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 <script> 等恶意标签的 num 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0261.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9408.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5078","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21573","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0955.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0955.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0955","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0955.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0955.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0955.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d2b90135469e518b8bd9c7142a1d639da966b67/2002/CVE-2002-0955.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0955.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0955.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0955.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0489.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0488","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0488.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0953","title":"PHP Address 远程文件包含漏洞","description":"PHP-Address 0.2e 及之前版本中的 globals.php 存在远程文件包含漏洞。当 PHP 的 allow_url_fopen 和 register_globals 选项启用时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 LangCookie 参数传递恶意 URL，实现远程文件包含，进而执行任意 PHP 代码。该漏洞影响 PHP-Address 0.2f 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已发布 0.2f 版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0953"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:27Z","remediation":"升级 PHP Address 至 0.2f 或更高版本。在 php.ini 中设置 allow_url_fopen = Off 和 register_globals = Off 以禁用危险配置。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面（如 .htaccess 或 Nginx 配置）对 LangCookie 参数进行输入过滤，阻止包含远程 URL 的请求。同时建议迁移至仍在维护的替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0182.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/277987","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9379.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5039","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21564","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2002/CVE-2002-0953.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0953.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0953.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0953","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0953.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2