s":["CVE-2002-0937"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:25Z","remediation":"升级JRun到最新版本，安装Macromedia提供的安全补丁（如JRun 4.0 Service Pack 1或更高版本），并禁止在JSP页面中使用sun.awt.windows.WPrinterJob类，或将其访问权限设置为仅限内部网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0095.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9339.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4997","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21536","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0937.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0937.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0937","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0937.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0937.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/20ec019115a0b1de7bc97fc35bb5f73fa34a0aae/2002/CVE-2002-0937.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0937.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0937.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0937.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0937.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0481.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0481.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0481.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0480","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0480.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0936","title":"Apache Tomcat JSP Engine 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 3.x 和 4.x 版本的 JSP 引擎在处理 WPrinterJob().pageSetup(null,null) 调用时存在拒绝服务漏洞。拥有 Web 页面发布权限的攻击者可通过上传或部署包含恶意 JSP 代码的页面触发该漏洞，导致 Tomcat 服务引擎崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响 Apache Tomcat 3.x 及 4.0.3 及更早版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0936"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:25Z","remediation":"升级到 Apache Tomcat 9.0.x 或更高版本（Tomcat 4.x 已停止支持，不再发布安全更新）。在生产环境中禁止非授权用户上传或部署 JSP 文件，删除默认的 examples 和 manager 示例应用目录。同时配置安全管理器（SecurityManager）限制 JSP 引擎调用系统打印相关 API 的权限。如无法立即升级，在反向代理层限制对 JSP 文件的写入和部署接口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0095.html","http://tomcat.apache.org/security-4.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9339.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4995","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/29dc6c2b625789e70a9c4756b5a327e6547273ff8bde7e0327af48c5%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/c62b0e3a7bf23342352a5810c640a94b6db69957c5c19db507004d74%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb71997f506c6cc8b530dd845c084995a9878098846c7b4eacfae8db3%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21534","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2002/CVE-2002-0936.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2002/CVE-2002-0936.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0936.json","https://github.com/p0dalirius/ApacheTomcatScanner/blob/af5077ce3aeae4c7df3be909998bb54e3812c742/apachetomcatscanner/data/vulnerabilities/2002/CVE-2002-0936.json