-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:24Z","remediation":"MyHelpDesk 已停止维护，官方未发布安全补丁。建议在 index.php 及所有工单处理脚本中对 Title、Description 及 id 参数使用 PHP 的 htmlspecialchars() 函数进行 HTML 实体转义，过滤 < > \" ' & 等特殊字符。同时建议迁移到仍受维护的替代工单系统（如 osTicket 或 Zammad）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0057.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9319.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9320.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4967","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4970","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21519","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0931.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0931.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0931","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0931.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0931.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2002/CVE-2002-0931.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0931.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0931.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0931.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-0931.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0478.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0478.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0477","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0477.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0928","title":"Pirch IRC 98 Client 畸形链接缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Pirch 98 IRC 客户端存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在频道或私聊消息中发送超长超链接触发该漏洞，导致目标系统拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Pirch 98 版本，攻击无需身份认证，利用复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已存在公开的利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0928"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:24Z","remediation":"Pirch 98 IRC 客户端已停止维护且不再发布安全更新，建议立即停止使用该软件，迁移至仍在维护的现代 IRC 客户端（如 HexChat、Irssi 等）。如暂时无法替换，切勿点击来自不可信来源的 IRC 频道或私聊消息中的超链接，并在网络层面过滤 IRC 协议中异常长度的链接数据包作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0256.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9409.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5079","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21574","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0928.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0928.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0928","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0928.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0928.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0928.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2002/CVE-2002-0928.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0928.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd134